  "This toggles the engine version to Unreal Engine 5.0–5.6, making this game eligible for the DOF Fix addon.\n\nUse this when RHI cannot detect the UE version automatically (e.g. Game Pass games).": {
    "translation": "这会将引擎版本设为 Unreal Engine 5.0–5.6，使此游戏可使用 DOF Fix 附加组件。\n\n当 RHI 无法自动检测 UE 版本（例如 Game Pass 游戏）时使用此选项。",
    "state": "reviewed",
    "source_hash": "4e2bd623bd7183d1468b0e431ded24025a9555be4b3a9521b2ca71f86a8844d5"
  },
  "This will remove ALL per-game NVIDIA driver profile overrides (DLSS/Streamline versions, presets, render scales, ReBAR, VSync, Smooth Motion, Low Latency, Power Mode — everything) AND reset global settings (Shader Cache, G-Sync, Refresh Rate, ReBAR) to defaults.\n\nAll profiles will return to NVIDIA factory defaults. This cannot be undone.": {
    "translation": "这将移除所有单游戏 NVIDIA 驱动配置文件覆盖（DLSS/Streamline 版本、预设、渲染比例、ReBAR、垂直同步、Smooth Motion、低延迟、电源模式——全部），并将全局设置（着色器缓存、G-Sync、刷新率、ReBAR）恢复为默认值。\n\n所有配置文件都将恢复到 NVIDIA 出厂默认状态。此操作无法撤销。",
    "state": "reviewed",
    "source_hash": "be13a68f278cd9d50bdb538cf904afeb94f0f23d2f0b30b40b475d22388d1c15"
  },
  "This will restore driver settings for {0} back to the factory default and restore DLSS/Streamline DLLs to their original versions. This action is irreversible.": {
    "translation": "这会将 {0} 的驱动设置恢复为出厂默认值，并将 DLSS/Streamline DLL 恢复到原始版本。此操作无法撤销。",
    "state": "reviewed",
